HIL Exchange
HL System Tool — Human-AI Inventory Exchange Interface
Part of the HL System (Human Layer) — MaxSpace Tool Solutions Free and open source. No rights reserved.


What This Is
HIL Exchange is a React-based interface for importing, viewing, and exporting HL-formatted inventory data.

It provides a visual layer between your physical space addresses and the records you maintain — allowing you to paste in an HL item list, review it, and export it in formats compatible with your vault platform of choice.


What It Does
Accepts HL-formatted item lists as input
Displays items with their address, name, category, and provenance fields
Allows inline editing of records
Exports to markdown, CSV, or JSON
Compatible with Obsidian, Notion, WikiJS, and GitHub vault formats


How to Use
Open HIL-exchange.jsx in a React environment or paste into a JSX-compatible sandbox (CodeSandbox, StackBlitz, etc.)
Paste your HL item list into the input panel
Review and edit records in the visual table
Export in your preferred format


